{"unit_id":"Artificialwhale__session-reader-plugin#card-zh","repo":"Artificialwhale/session-reader-plugin","commit":"86249f10875f0e07a3987d1ff90ad006174b64af","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-reader 是一款 DSH 插件，可让用户或 agent 在当前会话中查找并读取其他会话的记录。它接入 DSH 的工具和命令接口，提供 session_list 与 session_read 两个 agent 工具，以及无需模型回合即可执行的 /sessions 命令。用户可以按会话 id 或工作区筛选会话，并查看消息、工具调用与结果、推理分块、压缩后的模型可见内容或原始事件；读取结果支持关键词筛选、条数限制和截断显示。适合需要从已有会话中找回上下文的 DSH 用户。运行时使用宿主提供的 sessionQuery 服务，不需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:361-439","lib/index.js:162-227"]}
{"unit_id":"Artificialwhale__session-reader-plugin#card-en","repo":"Artificialwhale/session-reader-plugin","commit":"86249f10875f0e07a3987d1ff90ad006174b64af","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-reader helps DSH users browse other sessions. It adds session_list and session_read tools plus a /sessions command that runs immediately. Users can filter sessions and inspect messages, tools, reasoning, compacted content, or raw events. It uses the host sessionQuery service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:361-439","lib/index.js:162-227"]}
